{'symbol': 'RVTY', 'date': '2023-06-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYCOMB BIOTECHNOLOGIES AND REVVITY LAUNCH NEW SOLUTIONS TO EXPAND THE FRONTIERS OF SINGLE CELL RESEARCH', 'text': 'WALTHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, IN COLLABORATION WITH SINGLE CELL GENOMICS COMPANY, HONEYCOMB BIOTECHNOLOGIES (“HONEYCOMB”), REVVITY (NYSE: RVTY) ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A SUITE OF NEW SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES THAT EXPAND THE FRONTIERS OF SINGLE CELL BIOLOGY: THE HIVE™ CLX SINGLE-CELL RNASEQ SOLUTION, BEENETPLUS ANALYSIS WORKFLOW, AND FOR SINGLE CELL RESEARCHERS BASED IN THE UNITED STATES, A NEW HIVE CLX SERVICE OFFERING. THE HIVE CLX SINGLE-CELL RNASEQ SOLUTION OFFERS HIGHER DENSITY SING.'}